			"contractKind" : "contract",
			"documentation" : "@title Proma\r\n@dev ERC20 PROMA\r\n\n * PROMA Tokens are divisible by 1e8 (100,000,000) base\r\nunits referred to as 'MicroProms'.\r\n\n * PROMA are displayed using 8 decimal places of precision.\r\n\n * 1 PROMA is equivalent to:\r\n  100000000 == 1 * 10**8 == 1e8 == One Hundred Million MicroProms\r\n\n * 185 Million PROMA (total supply) is equivalent to:\r\n  185000000000000 == 185e6 * 10**8 == 185e14\r\n\n * All initial MicroProms are assigned to the creator of\r\nthis contract.\r",
